------------------------------------------------------
1.0.2 (2026-09-20)
------------------------------------------------------
* Slightly reduced the default font size of the energy bar.

------------------------------------------------------
1.0.1 (2026-09-20)
------------------------------------------------------
* Changed the default layout, size, colors and positions of all bars and icon rows.
* Fixed the debuff, proc and cooldown icons showing outside of combat while in Cat Form.
* Fixed the Moonfire debuff icon not being shown, including when Moonfire is used without Lunar Inspiration.
* Fixed resetting, copying or switching a profile not applying the settings until the UI is reloaded.
* Added a fallback to the bundled border, texture and font when the one selected in the options is no longer available.
* Changed the required Ace3 and LibSharedMedia libraries to be embedded in the addon instead of installed separately.

------------------------------------------------------
1.0.0 (2026-09-19)
------------------------------------------------------
* A Feral Druid addon for Cat Form. It adds its own energy bar, combo points, timers for important debuffs, and icons for key procs and cooldowns, all positioned exactly where you want them. It stays out of the way outside Cat Form.
